    "description": "# RF-15: Secondary Referrals Related List\n\n_Related list of Referrals where this Referrer is the Secondary Referrer — drives the milestone bonus, not a per-signup payout._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Columns: same shape as RF-14, scoped to Referrals where this Referrer is the Secondary Referrer\n\n* Drives the one-time milestone bonus once the linked Primary Referrer hits the qualifying signup threshold — not a standalone payout stream of its own.\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Split from the Primary Referrals list because they're linked to different fields on the Referral record\n\n* Kobi Kunasekaran, [1:38:27](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=5907): \"one for primary referrals and one for secondary referrals because they're linked to records separately.\" Joyce Kiddell confirms: \"Yes.\"\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: RF-15 (Referrer Record User Stories doc).\n* Depends on the Referral object existing — no Asana ticket for it yet.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc RF-15 — Referrer Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.lh55xwl5syhi)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Kobi Kunasekaran, 1:38:27 (primary/secondary split)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=5907)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-185 — Referrer: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693311564006/f/), [BUILD-198 — Referrer: Primary Referrals Related List](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693253886041/f/) (same list shape)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Referrer record documentation review.\n\n",
